    "title": "Plastics factory: motor control centre MCC-2 (extrusion line)", "project": "EX-24",
    "client": "Example Plastics Plant", "author": "uniwire examples", "lang": "en",
    "notes": [
      "Demonstrates: the five classic motor feeders (DOL with MPCB + contactor, reversing, star-delta, VFD, soft starter with bypass) and an S7-1200 PLC with its modules addressed by channel ports",
      "Motor cables of VFD feeders: screened, 360° EMC glands both ends",
      "Star-delta compressor: two 4G16 cables (U1-V1-W1 / W2-U2-V2), each sized for the delta current In/√3"
    ]
  },
  "installation": {"earthing": "TN-S", "system": "3P", "un_V": 400, "f_Hz": 50, "ik3_kA": 30, "standard": "IEC 60364 / IEC 61439-2"},
